    "intro": "A good code name sounds like something and means nothing: a bird, a stone, a bit of weather or an old piece of kit. This **code name generator** makes them for spies and agents, military-style operations, work and software projects, NATO-style call signs and young secret agents, and leaves out the famous ones.",
    "sections": [
